" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Carlos explains how to change your outfit, and how to sell items to NPCs. Although Carlos exists, he can only be encountered by players who are still at the tutorial island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>, since the implementation of <a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnport\">Dawnport</a> made the tutorial island inaccessible.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not sell anything.</p></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Carlos.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Carlos</strong>: Hey there, <i>player</i>! Well, that's how trading with NPCs like me works. I think you are ready now to cross the bridge to Rookgaard! Take care!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Carlos</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><